{"id":23032,"name":"唯有香如故","rarity":5,"path":"Priest","desc":"丰饶命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「第一件，整顿工作习惯。」 </i>\\n<i>「第二件，严格执行奖惩规定。」 </i>\\n<i>「当然，最要紧的还是尽快查清那些盘根错节的利益关系……」</i>\\n本在欣赏湖光山色，思绪又不知不觉滑向了工作，压力和烦躁也随之而来。\\n\\n她赶紧点燃一柱随身携带的安神香。\\n<i>「世界如此美妙，我却如此暴躁…休假的日子，就别想那些烦人的事了……」 </i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23032,"name":"安心","desc":"使装备者击破特攻提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者施放终结技攻击敌方目标后，使其陷入【忘忧】状态，持续<unbreak>#5[i]</unbreak>回合，【忘忧】状态下的敌方目标受到的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>，若装备者当前击破特攻大于等于<unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak>，受到的伤害提高效果额外提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.6,0.1,1.5,0.08,2]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.7,0.12,1.5,0.1,2]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.8,0.14,1.5,0.12,2]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.9,0.16,1.5,0.14,2]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[1,0.18,1.5,0.16,2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":24,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":113001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":52.8,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110241,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":113001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":91.2,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110242,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":113002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":129.6,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110242,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":113002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":168,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":168,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110243,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":113003,"ItemNum":6}]},"5":{"h